  <text decls="#source_1">
    <body>
      <div type="illustration" facs="#zone_picture">
        <figure xml:id="figure_1" ana="#home"><desc>A grand piano in a room, a framed portrait of a seventeenth-century gentleman on the wall, a side table with a lamp</desc></figure>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_headline">
        <head><hi rendition="#c"><lb/><hi rendition="#in">The <name type="brand">HEINTZMAN</name></hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#i #larger"><name type="brand">Welte - Mignon</name></hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#g">REPRODUCING PIANO</hi></hi></head>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_text">
        <p><lb/><seg xml:id="topic_1" ana="#touch_of_a_button" type="topic" resp="#claude">The famous compositions of the ages played by
          <lb/>internationally famous pianists are at your com-
          <lb/>mand</seg>. Through the <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon Reproducing
          <lb/>Piano</name>, <seg xml:id="topic_2" ana="#home" type="topic" resp="#claude">the genius of <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118986724">Paderewski</persName>, <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/116014490">De Pachmann</persName>,
          <lb/>and hundreds of others of the musically great, is
          <lb/>transported to your home</seg> for your entertainment.
          <lb/><seg xml:id="topic_3" ana="#superiority" type="topic" resp="#claude"><name type="brand">Welte Mignon</name> was the first reproducing piano pro-
          <lb/>nounced perfect by great artists—it is still so
          <lb/>regarded</seg>.</p>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_stewart">
        <ab><hi rendition="#c"><lb/><hi rendition="#b #larger"><persName type="artist">Reginald Stewart</persName></hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#b #i">Famous Canadian Concert Pianist
          <lb/>is an exclusive <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name>
          <lb/>Artist.</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#i #smaller">The following Recordings by
          <lb/><persName type="artist">Reginald Stewart</persName> are now
          <lb/>obtainable at Heintzman Hall.</hi></hi></ab>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_recordings">
        <list>
          <item><lb/>Sonata in C Major, op. 2, No. 3
            <lb/>Parts 1, 2, 3, 4 ......<persName type="composer" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118508288">Beethoven</persName></item>
          <item><lb/>Humoreske ..........<persName type="composer" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118638157">Tschaikowsky</persName></item>
          <item><lb/>Watteau Paysage .......<persName type="composer" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118964046">Godowsky</persName></item>
          <item><lb/>Tambourin Chinois, <persName type="composer" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/119069261">Kreisler</persName>-<persName type="composer">Chaliff</persName></item>
          <item><lb/>Minuet from <sic>L’Artesienne</sic> ........
            <lb/><persName type="composer" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118511440">Bizet</persName>-<persName type="composer" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118641832">Rachmaninoff</persName></item>
          <item><lb/>Liebesfreud ..<persName type="composer" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/119069261">Kreisler</persName>-<persName type="composer" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118641832">Rachmaninoff</persName></item>
        </list>
      </div>
      <div type="illustration" facs="#zone_portrait">
        <figure><desc>Photographic portrait of Reginald Stewart in profile</desc></figure>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_invitation">
        <ab><hi rendition="#c #b #i #smaller"><lb/>Visit our Music Salon and hear the wonderful <name type="brand">Heintzman
          <lb/>Welte-Mignon</name> play for you the music of the masters.</hi></ab>
      </div>
